            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Chay Huong Khach",
            "review_text": "nrm77\nLondon, United Kingdom1020 contributions\n0\nVietnamese vegetarian\nJul 2019\nI was here with my husband and kids for a quick meal before our trip to SunWorld Ba Na Hills. The restaurant is an old restaurant located close to the airport in Danang. The restaurant manager was a very friendly person who was very accommodating for our needs as we were travelling with kids. The vegetarian food here seemed to have a lot of fish - which we don't eat- so we had stir fried veggies (mushroom and bamboo shoots) with Thai rice. The food was quite good actually. The staff and service was friendly and good. Definitely one of the better veg only restaurants in Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2019",
