            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Chay Huong Khach",
            "review_text": "Cardinal2010\nToronto, Canada65 contributions\n0\nOk food, otherwise odd\nNov 2016 • Family\nSeveral of the dishes we wanted were not available and no suggestions were made by staff. Most other customers ordered hot pot. Staff were not personable and seemed upset.\n Other tables got complimentary tea, we did not. The sautéed eggplant was not tasty with too many peppercorns, imo. The \"pork\" ribs had a good taste and texture. It was a very strange night, we felt uncomfortable, very unlike all other Restos in Vietnam. Hopefully just an off night for them, because reviews are so good and most veggie places have been super-friendly. However, I would not return here.\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2016",
